{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:48:973","content":{"id":973,"title":"Vibe Learning","content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个功能的灵感来自于 NotebookLM，这个应用支持用户上传资料，然后通过和 AI 聊天来学习资料，并且还可以生成 PPT，视频，测验来帮助用户来进一步的理解内容，学习效率很高，于是我也尝试在本地复现了这个功能，因为这种学习方式和 Vibe Coding 很像，氛围式学习，所以我把这个功能叫做 Vibe Learning。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"根据我的计划，项目代表的就是近期学习的一个主题，因此这种学习方式天然就适合作为一个项目，创建项目时类型选择 Vibe Learning"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_65c317f6-4196-4af9-a1a2-2984241e12cf.webp","uuid":"115ad2a1-f396-4c5c-a1a3-6de1a9a2e505","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_65c317f6-4196-4af9-a1a2-2984241e12cf.webp","width":720},{"type":"header","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"界面介绍"}],"disableDrag":false,"level":2},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2b8de72a-5cc5-4ad5-8d37-4cd7f4f0afd2.webp","uuid":"b1c3a446-f25a-47a7-b426-623e3b75f2cb","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_2b8de72a-5cc5-4ad5-8d37-4cd7f4f0afd2.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"界面分为三个部分："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"左侧是用户上传的资料"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_89f18755-8b15-4799-ab31-4adbaa1f50ea.webp","uuid":"2cd49030-25d5-42f3-9cde-ff73a44128e5","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_89f18755-8b15-4799-ab31-4adbaa1f50ea.webp","width":720},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"资料可以是本地的文件，也可以是一个网页地址，也可以是 B 站或者 Youtube 视频，也可以是用户自己的笔记。不管用户上传的是什么，都会被转化为文本："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"音视频，通过"},{"type":"content-link","contentId":5911,"contentType":"project-item","contentTitle":"视频笔记","refId":972,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"视频笔记"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"中的那套转录流程，将音视频变成带有时间戳的文本"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"网页，通过大模型或者 Web Clipper 程序将网页内容变为纯文本"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"PDF、Word 等文件，通过一些程序将其转化为纯文本"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"图片，使用支持多模态的大语言模型对图片进行理解，然后输出为文字，需要在大语言模型中进行配置"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_148523ea-7308-45a2-aaee-0e59599fd0d5.webp","uuid":"4271ad78-9556-4a13-96d5-c166b41230de","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_148523ea-7308-45a2-aaee-0e59599fd0d5.webp","width":720}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"转化为文本后就是索引，参考"},{"type":"content-link","contentId":4919,"contentType":"project-item","contentTitle":"搜索","refId":765,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"搜索"}]},{"text":"部分，将文本转化为向量存储，当用户和 AI 进行对话时，可以先进行搜索将相关的上下文注入 AI 来回答用户问题。","type":"formatted"}]},{"type":"highlight-block","color":"red","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"其实仅仅对资料进行向量化还是不够的，因为这种搜索只能搜索到一些片段，如果用户的问题依赖一大块连续的内容作为上下文回答，那么这种方式就做不到。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"因此为了应对这个问题，还有一个进行摘要的，对比较长的资料，自下而上进行内容的总结，形成一棵摘要树，树的最顶层是整个资料的摘要，然后从顶层出去就是各个章节的摘要，每个章节又可以形成自己的子章节摘要。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"形成这一棵摘要树之后，假设用户问了一个问题，模型就可以根据问题从树的顶层根据摘要判断和哪些章节内容相关，从树的顶层到叶子层，一般不会超过五层，也就是最多五次就可以知道相关的章节，这个时候模型就可以直接把这个章节的整体读入，就有了一大块连续的上下文去回答问题。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为了生成摘要树，需要在大语言模型中配置"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_d0e528f1-2999-4393-b738-624cd54bdf20.webp","uuid":"f6b935ef-3f38-4e75-9a8a-1e296784e413","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_d0e528f1-2999-4393-b738-624cd54bdf20.webp","width":720}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"中间就是对话区"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"用户在这里就可以和 AI 就提供的资料进行对话，AI 会先尝试调用内部提供的各种工具去获取相关的上下文去回答用户问题"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_0eb20573-7e27-41d7-aa69-72d45a89e40d.webp","uuid":"10ae4c90-cec7-4b6f-8ad9-1d370a095d3e","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_0eb20573-7e27-41d7-aa69-72d45a89e40d.webp","width":720}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"右侧是辅助学习区"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_44f26dfa-232f-4329-a9f7-979741b7db23.webp","uuid":"f9573bcc-dd27-430b-84d6-4d7ede196540","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_44f26dfa-232f-4329-a9f7-979741b7db23.webp","width":548.0210266077708},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"我们可以让 AI 基于我们提供的资料来生成一些帮助我们理解这资料的产物，比如思维导图、PPT、测验和播客等，模型生成的内容会放在创作内容中，我们也可以记录一些在和 AI 沟通过程的思考和灵感，然后不论是 AI 生成的资料还是我们的笔记，也可以反向放入到左侧的资料中，提供更加丰富的上下文，我们也可以把这些资料放入到我们的卡片库和知识库中（我不推荐直接把 AI 生成的内容放入我们的知识库中，还是要自己总结更好）。"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"经过这种反复迭代高强度用脑的过程，可以帮助我们非常快的掌握这些资料，我认为这才是 AI 时代正确的学习方法，让 AI 帮助我们学习，而不是把一切都交给 AI。"}]}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"软件使用文档","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:735","type":"doc","id":735}},{"label":"功能模块","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:745","type":"doc","id":745}},{"label":"高级功能","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:769","type":"doc","id":769}},{"label":"Vibe Learning","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:973","type":"doc","id":973}}],"prevPage":{"title":"视频笔记","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:972","type":"doc","id":972}},"nextPage":{"title":"闪卡","target":{"key":"doc:project:48:975","type":"doc","id":975}},"createTime":1777708990190,"updateTime":1777719756324,"projectId":48},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1777719756324},"links":{"project-item:972":{"key":"doc:project:48:972","type":"doc","id":972},"project-item:765":{"key":"doc:project:48:765","type":"doc","id":765}}}